   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "When washing dishes, leaving the faucet running utilizes about 15 gal every 5 minutes, where filling the sink and turning the faucet off except to rinse the dishes uses about 5 gal for washing a dishpan-sized load of dishes. How much water is saved by not leaving the faucet running if it takes 10 minutes to wash a dishpan-sized load of dishes each day for a month containing 30 days?",
